{"term": {"label": "愛", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 7, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "天下", "id": "天下"}, {"form": "愛", "variants": [], "id": "愛"}, {"form": "敵", "id": "敵"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.9631743177730056, "source": "敵", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.9848255653049869, "source": "敵", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.7765850345330416, "source": "敵", "target": "天下"}, {"weight": 1.5793604571968225, "source": "至", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.0834378539730967, "source": "至", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 2.272507637756768, "source": "愛", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9848255653049869, "source": "伐", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0685348334308318, "source": "用", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.265759410767051, "source": "用", "target": "勝"}, {"weight": 0.557709209664841, "source": "天下", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.272507637756768, "source": "天下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.15224410155667667, "source": "仁", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.2916783847450415, "source": "仁", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.761682013990777, "source": "仁", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.9848255653049869, "source": "仁", "target": "勝"}, {"weight": 0.04688358589885046, "source": "人", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 0.2700271372130602, "source": "人", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.8794650496471605, "source": "國", "target": "信"}]}}